else.\n\nEvery failure throws `GlobError`, and a positional one carries the 0-based `index` into the pattern where the fault starts: `unterminated character class` (index of the opening bracket), `trailing backslash` (index of the backslash), and `path separator in character class` (index of the `/`). An empty pattern (`pattern must not be empty`) and a non-string pattern (`pattern must be a string`) are rejected without an index, as are a non-string path (`path must be a string`) and a non-array first argument to `filter` (`paths must be an array`).",
